<title>USA: Medical Dynamics retains investment banker.</title>
<headline>Medical Dynamics retains investment banker.</headline>
<dateline>ENGLEWOOD, Colo. 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Medical Dynamics Inc said on Wednesday it has retained Bathgate McColley Capital Group LLC as its investment banker.</p>
<p>Medical Dynamics said the firm will advise it on a variety of strategic business development issues, including potential acquisitions, divestitures and capital formation.</p>
